CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'msg_head->ival1.tv_sec < 0'
#1286: FILE: net/can/bcm.c:145:
+	if ((msg_head->ival1.tv_sec < 0) ||
